  "description": "Test build of Heimerdinger as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Heimerdinger so his H-28G turrets and the H-28Q apex turret fire visible shots from their muzzles (the charged beam at a crowd-controlled champion, then the nearest champion, then the nearest unit; damage on arrival), and Hextech Affinity also speeds him up near his side's towers (the main pack: the turrets' damage lands on the target at once and the speed comes from his turrets only); while R's upgrade waits, his AI spends it well: CH-3X (E) at enemy champions standing together, else the apex turret (Q). 0.3.0: every turret and the apex has a body of its own through the mod API's spawn_unit - targetable, it can be destroyed (26% of his health + 30% of his ability power, the apex 85% + 50%), it does not walk and its own attack harms nobody; the add-on fires its shots from the body's spot, a destroyed body stops its turret and frees Q's slot; a host that gives no unit keeps the side pictures. Needs the main pack's sheets league/champions/league_heimerdinger_h28g and _h28q. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
